WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.800
Hello! If you have a home project, ServiciiAproape helps you find companies working in your area.

00:05.800 --> 00:10.400
Choose your county, locality, and the service you need.

00:10.400 --> 00:18.300
Compare companies, then open complete profiles to see descriptions, contact details, and photographs of completed work.

00:18.300 --> 00:23.900
Once you find the right company, contact it directly or send a quote request.

00:23.900 --> 00:26.100
Simple, local, and easy to check.
